>私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.771" end="9.161">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.161" end="9.761">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.761" end="10.280">し</span></span></span><span begin="10.280" end="10.891">へ</span><span begin="10.891" end="13.480">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">致某天的我</span></p><p begin="39.621" end="43.060" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.621" end="39.911">す</span></span></span><span begin="39.911" end="40.211">ぎ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.211" end="40.531">さ</span></span></span><span begin="40.531" end="40.981">り</span><span begin="40.981" end="41.201">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.201" end="41.851">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">々</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.851" end="43.060">び</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">逝去的岁月</span></p><p begin="43.431" end="50.780" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="43.431" end="43.671">ま</span><span begin="43.671" end="45.340">だ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鮮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.161" end="46.471">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.471" end="46.731">ざ</span></span></span><span begin="46.731" end="47.321">や</span><span begin="47.321" end="47.601">か</span><span begin="47.601" end="48.131">な</span><span begin="48.131" end="48.460">ま</span><span begin="48.460" end="50.780">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">依然 如此鲜明</span></p><p begin="52.581" end="56.680" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">帰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.581" end="52.821">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.821" end="53.000">え</span></span></span><span begin="53.000" end="53.180">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.180" end="53.501">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.501" end="53.780">ち</span></span></span><span begin="53.780" end="54.011">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">背</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.011" end="54.771">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.771" end="55.491">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.491" end="55.880">か</span></span></span><span begin="55.880" end="56.680">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">归途上的那道背影</span></p><p begin="57.061" end="1:02.686" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">遠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="57.061" end="57.471">とお</span></span></span><span begin="57.471" end="58.380">く</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.841" end="59.001">み</span></span></span><span begin="59.001" end="59.240">て</span><span begin="59.240" end="59.401">い</span><span begin="59.401" end="59.791">た</span><span begin="59.791" end="1:00.571">だ</span><span begin="1:00.571" end="1:00.801">け</span><span begin="1:00.801" end="1:02.686">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我只是 远远地望着</span></p><p begin="1:03.291" end="1:09.140" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.291" end="1:03.691">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.691" end="1:04.091">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.091" end="1:05.231">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:05.231" end="1:05.641">に</span><span begin="1:05.641" end="1:06.171">な</span><span begin="1:06.171" end="1:06.771">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.771" end="1:07.181">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.181" end="1:07.511">び</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">路</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.511" end="1:07.801">じ</span></span></span><span begin="1:07.801" end="1:09.140">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在长成大人的旅途中</span></p><p begin="1:09.521" end="1:15.400" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.521" end="1:09.911">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.911" end="1:10.161">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.161" end="1:11.060">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幾</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.461" end="1:11.861">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.861" end="1:12.221">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.221" end="1:12.631">つ</span><span begin="1:12.631" end="1:13.080">も</span><span begin="1:13.080" end="1:13.411">の</span><span begin="1:13.411" end="1:14.511">岐</span><span begin="1:14.511" end="1:15.400">路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">掠过无数的岔路</span></p><p begin="1:15.751" end="1:22.760" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:15.751" end="1:16.171">あ</span><span begin="1:16.171" end="1:16.521">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.521" end="1:17.311">ひ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.311" end="1:17.721">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.721" end="1:17.951">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:17.951" end="1:18.461">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.461" end="1:18.871">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.871" end="1:19.260">も</span></span></span><span begin="1:19.260" end="1:19.680">い</span><span begin="1:19.680" end="1:20.021">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">伝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.021" end="1:20.451">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.451" end="1:20.800">た</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.800" end="1:21.061">え</span><span begin="1:21.061" end="1:21.560">て</span><span begin="1:21.560" end="1:21.991">い</span><span begin="1:21.991" end="1:22.401">た</span><span begin="1:22.401" end="1:22.760">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如果那天 向你传达了心意</span></p><p begin="1:22.771" end="1:27.620" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:22.771" end="1:23.161">ど</span><span begin="1:23.161" end="1:23.381">ん</span><span begin="1:23.381" end="1:24.890">な</span> <span begin="1:25.511" end="1:25.881">現</span><span begin="1:25.881" end="1:26.881">在</span><span begin="1:26.881" end="1:27.261">だっ</span><span begin="1:27.261" end="1:27.620">た?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">会是怎样的 现在呢？</span></p><p begin="1:27.891" end="1:34.420" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:27.891" end="1:28.291">ねぇ</span><span begin="1:28.291" end="1:28.591">「さ</span><span begin="1:28.591" end="1:28.801">よ</span><span begin="1:28.801" end="1:29.011">な</span><span begin="1:29.011" end="1:29.281">ら」</span><span begin="1:29.281" end="1:29.620">さ</span><span begin="1:29.620" end="1:30.191">え</span><span begin="1:30.191" end="1:30.421">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.421" end="1:30.960">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:30.960" end="1:31.291">え</span><span begin="1:31.291" end="1:31.751">ず</span><span begin="1:31.751" end="1:32.460">に</span><span begin="1:32.460" end="1:32.700">い</span><span begin="1:32.700" end="1:32.921">る</span><span begin="1:32.921" end="1:33.301">か</span><span begin="1:33.301" end="1:34.420">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">呐 因为连一句“再见”也还说不出口</span></p><p begin="1:34.831" end="1:40.580" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.831" end="1:35.031">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.031" end="1:35.231">ま</span></span></span><span begin="1:35.231" end="1:35.621">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.621" end="1:36.051">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.051" end="1:36.391">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:36.391" end="1:37.051">は</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">想い出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.051" end="1:37.571">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.571" end="1:37.811">こ</span></span></span><span begin="1:37.811" end="1:38.381">で</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.381" end="1:38.731">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.731" end="1:39.521">らっ</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.521" end="1:40.580">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如今你依然 在回忆里 微笑着</span></p><p begin="1:40.921" end="1:46.980" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.921" end="1:41.271">ちゅう</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.271" end="1:41.471">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.471" end="1:41.810">ま</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.810" end="1:42.051">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.051" end="1:42.660">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.660" end="1:42.861">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.861" end="1:43.411">ば</span></span></span><span begin="1:43.411" end="1:43.721">た</span><span begin="1:43.721" end="1:44.180">ち</span><span begin="1:44.180" end="1:44.921">を</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">綴っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.921" end="1:45.361">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.361" end="1:45.771">づっ</span></span></span><span begin="1:45.771" end="1:46.980">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将空中飞舞的话语 细细写下</span></p><p begin="1:47.281" end="1:54.996" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.281" end="1:47.441">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.441" end="1:47.681">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.681" end="1:48.101">か</span><span begin="1:48.101" end="1:48.491">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.491" end="1:48.881">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.881" end="1:49.551">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.551" end="1:50.020">し</span></span></span><span begin="1:50.020" end="1:50.671">へ</span><span begin="1:50.671" end="1:52.951">と</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">届</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.951" end="1:53.221">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.221" end="1:53.401">ど</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.401" end="1:54.996">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">传达给 某天的我吧</span></p><p begin="2:06.921" end="2:18.460" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.921" end="2:07.181">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.181" end="2:07.580">ま</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.580" end="2:07.811">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">込</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.811" end="2:08.361">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.361" end="2:08.581">ん</span><span begin="2:08.581" end="2:09.121">で</span><span begin="2:09.121" end="2:10.661">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.661" end="2:10.901">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.901" end="2:12.640">め</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.421" end="2:13.741">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.741" end="2:13.951">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">降</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.951" end="2:14.621">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="2:14.621" end="2:14.811">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.811" end="2:15.400">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.400" end="2:15.601">る</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.601" end="2:18.460">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">深藏心底的梦 在繁星降落的夜里</span></p><p begin="2:19.861" end="2:21.811" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:19.861" end="2:20.051">こ</span><span begin="2:20.051" end="2:20.261">こ</span><span begin="2:20.261" end="2:20.550">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">居</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.550" end="2:20.831">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.831" end="2:21.031">る</span><span begin="2:21.031" end="2:21.300">よ</span> <span begin="2:21.411" end="2:21.811">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻声说着 “我就在这里呀”</span></p><p begin="2:21.981" end="2:29.720" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.981" end="2:22.771">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.771" end="2:23.161">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.161" end="2:24.050">だ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.321" end="2:24.531">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.531" end="2:24.631">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:24.631" end="2:25.760">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">輝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.081" end="2:26.511">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.511" end="2:26.771">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.771" end="2:27.080">や</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.080" end="2:27.441">い</span><span begin="2:27.441" end="2:27.820">て</span><span begin="2:27.820" end="2:28.061">い</span><span begin="2:28.061" end="2:29.720">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">流着泪水 闪烁着光芒</span></p><p begin="2:30.561" end="2:38.280" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.561" end="2:30.981">て</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.981" end="2:31.281">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">入</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.281" end="2:32.521">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.521" end="2:32.911">れ</span><span begin="2:32.911" end="2:33.391">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.391" end="2:34.030">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.030" end="2:34.451">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.451" end="2:34.711">わ</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.711" end="2:35.020">せ</span><span begin="2:35.020" end="2:36.451">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">守</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.791" end="2:37.201">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.201" end="2:37.411">も</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.411" end="2:38.280">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">守护着已经拥有的幸福</span></p><p begin="2:38.591" end="2:42.660" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:38.591" end="2:39.161">そ</span><span begin="2:39.161" end="2:39.481">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">引</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.481" end="2:39.901">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="2:39.901" end="2:40.291">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">換</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.291" end="2:40.660">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.660" end="2:41.851">え</span><span begin="2:41.851" end="2:42.660">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">而作为交换</span></p><p begin="2:43.021" end="2:50.020" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.021" end="2:43.441">て</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">放</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.441" end="2:43.811">ば</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.811" end="2:44.511">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.511" end="2:44.971">し</span><span begin="2:44.971" end="2:45.140">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.140" end="2:45.761">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.761" end="2:46.111">の</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.111" end="2:46.571">ぜん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">部</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.571" end="2:46.921">ぶ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">追</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.921" end="2:47.360">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:47.360" end="2:47.711">い</span><span begin="2:47.711" end="2:48.091">か</span><span begin="2:48.091" end="2:48.301">け</span><span begin="2:48.301" end="2:48.860">て</span><span begin="2:48.860" end="2:49.261">い</span><span begin="2:49.261" end="2:49.691">た</span><span begin="2:49.691" end="2:50.020">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">若是去追寻 所有曾放手的梦</span></p><p begin="2:50.041" end="2:54.960" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:50.041" end="2:50.440">ど</span><span begin="2:50.440" end="2:50.671">ん</span><span begin="2:50.671" end="2:52.130">な</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">自分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.820" end="2:52.971">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.971" end="2:53.140">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.140" end="2:54.161">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:54.161" end="2:54.541">だっ</span><span begin="2:54.541" end="2:54.960">た?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">会是怎样的 自己呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">donna watashi datta?</span></p><p begin="2:55.321" end="2:57.680" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:55.321" end="2:55.680">ねぇ</span><span begin="2:55.680" end="2:55.891">「あ</span><span begin="2:55.891" end="2:56.081">り</span><span begin="2:56.081" end="2:56.281">が</span><span begin="2:56.281" end="2:56.420">と</span><span begin="2:56.420" end="2:56.581">う」</span><span begin="2:56.581" end="2:56.900">さ</span><span begin="2:56.900" end="2:57.481">え</span><span begin="2:57.481" end="2:57.680">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">呐 因为连一句“谢谢”</span></p><p begin="2:57.711" end="3:01.780" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:57.711" end="2:58.240">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:58.240" end="2:58.561">え</span><span begin="2:58.561" end="2:59.021">ず</span><span begin="2:59.021" end="2:59.740">に</span><span begin="2:59.740" end="2:59.980">い</span><span begin="2:59.980" end="3:00.171">る</span><span begin="3:00.171" end="3:00.561">か</span><span begin="3:00.561" end="3:01.780">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也还说不出口</span></p><p begin="3:02.111" end="3:07.920" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="3:02.111" end="3:02.331">ま</span><span begin="3:02.331" end="3:02.531">だ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.531" end="3:02.911">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.911" end="3:03.260">た</span></span></span><span begin="3:03.260" end="3:03.681">え</span><span begin="3:03.681" end="3:04.491">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.491" end="3:04.761">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.761" end="3:05.071">せ</span><span begin="3:05.071" end="3:05.600">な</span><span begin="3:05.600" end="3:06.051">い</span><span begin="3:06.051" end="3:06.431">ま</span><span begin="3:06.431" end="3:06.821">ま</span><span begin="3:06.821" end="3:07.920">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">依然 无法找到答案</span></p><p begin="3:08.151" end="3:14.200" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.151" end="3:08.571">ちゅう</span></span></span><span begin="3:08.571" end="3:08.781">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.781" end="3:09.160">ま</span></span></span><span begin="3:09.160" end="3:09.381">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.381" end="3:09.971">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.971" end="3:10.171">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.171" end="3:10.731">ば</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.731" end="3:11.021">た</span><span begin="3:11.021" end="3:11.460">ち</span><span begin="3:11.460" end="3:12.201">を</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">綴っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.201" end="3:12.611">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.611" end="3:13.041">づっ</span></span></span><span begin="3:13.041" end="3:14.200">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将空中飞舞的话语 细细写下</span></p><p begin="3:14.581" end="3:20.560" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.581" end="3:14.741">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.741" end="3:14.981">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:14.981" end="3:15.371">か</span><span begin="3:15.371" end="3:15.761">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:15.761" end="3:16.141">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.141" end="3:16.801">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.801" end="3:17.300">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:17.300" end="3:18.011">へ</span><span begin="3:18.011" end="3:20.560">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">致某天的我</span></p><p begin="3:20.610" end="3:26.620" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">届</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.610" end="3:20.831">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.831" end="3:21.020">ど</span></span></span><span begin="3:21.020" end="3:21.211">い</span><span begin="3:21.211" end="3:21.621">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.621" end="3:21.831">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.831" end="3:22.421">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:22.421" end="3:22.621">ば</span></span></span><span begin="3:22.621" end="3:23.181">は</span> <span begin="3:23.181" end="3:23.481">岐</span><span begin="3:23.481" end="3:23.920">路</span><span begin="3:23.920" end="3:24.711">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">照</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:24.711" end="3:25.101">てら</span></span></span><span begin="3:25.101" end="3:25.401">ら</span><span begin="3:25.401" end="3:25.580">し</span><span begin="3:25.580" end="3:26.620">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">传达而至的话语 照亮了岔路</span></p><p begin="3:27.061" end="3:32.800" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.061" end="3:27.221">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.221" end="3:27.441">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:27.441" end="3:27.831">か</span><span begin="3:27.831" end="3:28.221">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.221" end="3:28.631">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:28.631" end="3:29.231">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:29.231" end="3:29.781">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:29.781" end="3:30.100">が</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.100" end="3:30.551">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.551" end="3:30.881">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.881" end="3:31.120">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:31.120" end="3:31.361">に</span><span begin="3:31.361" end="3:31.551">な</span><span begin="3:31.551" end="3:31.751">る</span><span begin="3:31.751" end="3:32.800">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">某天的我 终将成为我自己</span></p><p begin="3:33.111" end="3:39.160" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.111" end="3:33.301">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.301" end="3:33.491">こ</span></span></span><span begin="3:33.491" end="3:33.671">と</span><span begin="3:33.671" end="3:34.020">現</span><span begin="3:34.020" end="3:34.260">在</span><span begin="3:34.260" end="3:34.871">を</span> <span begin="3:34.871" end="3:35.111">こ</span><span begin="3:35.111" end="3:35.641">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.641" end="3:36.011">む</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.011" end="3:36.431">ね</span></span></span><span begin="3:36.431" end="3:37.111">に</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">綴っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:37.111" end="3:37.551">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:37.551" end="3:37.971">づっ</span></span></span><span begin="3:37.971" end="3:39.160">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将过去与现在 写进这心间</span></p><p begin="3:39.511" end="3:47.966" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="3:39.511" end="3:39.721">ま</span><span begin="3:39.721" end="3:39.881">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">次</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.881" end="3:40.321">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.321" end="3:40.721">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="3:40.721" end="3:41.081">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">未</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.081" end="3:41.881">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">来</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.881" end="3:42.491">らい</span></span></span><span begin="3:42.491" end="3:43.001">へ</span><span begin="3:43.001" end="3:44.600">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歩</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:45.181" end="3:45.671">あ</span></span></span><span begin="3:45.671" end="3:47.966">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">再次迈步 走向下一个未来</span></p></div></body></tt>